From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:29:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] webOS: transcode stickers to PNG and send WebP files as
 stickers

The webOS WebKit has no WebP decoder, so a received sticker is decoded
with golang.org/x/image/webp and written as PNG (animated stickers
show their first frame). A .webp file sent from the app goes out as a
sticker, as WhatsApp clients do.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [webOS specific]
---
 go.mod               |  1 +
 go.sum               |  2 ++
 handle_attachment.go | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 send_file.go         | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

